it('provider pause stops reservations, resume preserves exact paid expiry and original allowance',async()=>{await cutover();await enable(monthly);const i=await bound(monthly);await call('cluera_billing_event_accept',[event(1,'subscription.charged',true),digest]);await apply(i,1,'GRANT',true);const before=(await rows('public.customer_usage_grants'))[0];const x={...event(2,'subscription.paused',true),paymentId:null,orderId:null,invoiceId:null};await call('cluera_billing_event_accept',[x,digest]);await apply(i,2,'STATUS',true,{subscriptionState:'PAUSED'});expect((await rows('public.customer_usage_grants'))[0].state).toBe('PAUSED');expect((await call('customer_usage_balance',[user,session])).availableMilliseconds).toBe(900000);await call('cluera_billing_event_accept',[{...x,eventId:'evt_synthetic0003',eventType:'subscription.resumed'},digest]);await apply(i,3,'STATUS',true,{subscriptionState:'ACTIVE'});const after=(await rows('public.customer_usage_grants'))[0];expect(after.state).toBe('ACTIVE');expect(after.expires_at).toEqual(before.expires_at);expect(after.granted_ms).toBe(before.granted_ms);});
